(7677965, 1255213, 181756, '<td valign="top">This is just a great example of street photography; there is so much happening in this image. There are four separate stories happening at once, five if you count the mannequin''s tale. The still-life nature of this shot is nicely disrupted by the movement in the background. The mirroring of the feet of the mannequin''s feet with the first person, the theme of legs throughout the right side, combined with the helter-skelter left side with the headless mannequin and the disembodied head - just all of this is super!</td>', 'This is just a great example of street photography; there is so much happening in this image. There are four separate stories happening at once, five if you count the mannequin''s tale. The still-life nature of this shot is nicely disrupted by the movement in the background. The mirroring of the feet of the mannequin''s feet with the first person, the theme of legs throughout the right side, combined with the helter-skelter left side with the headless mannequin and the disembodied head - just all of this is super!', '2020-10-27 16:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677966, 1255498, 181756, '<td valign="top">Great timing! And bravo for this shot not being blown out!</td>', 'Great timing! And bravo for this shot not being blown out!', '2020-10-27 16:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
